The text of the acts in this repository is taken from the Revised Acts published by the Law Reform Commission of
Ireland (Coimisiún um Athchóiriú an Dlí), Styne House, Upper Hatch Street, Dublin 2, at
https://revisedacts.lawreform.ie. Each Revised Act states:

    This Revised Act is an administrative consolidation of the [Act]. It is prepared by the Law Reform Commission in
    accordance with its function under the Law Reform Commission Act 1975 (3/1975) to keep the law under review and
    to undertake revision and consolidation of statute law.

    Disclaimer: While every care has been taken in the preparation of this Revised Act, the Law Reform Commission can
    assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy,
    completeness or up to date nature of the information provided and does not accept any liability whatsoever
    arising from any errors or omissions. Please notify any errors, omissions and comments by email to
    revisedacts@lawreform.ie.

Only the Acts as enacted, published on the electronic Irish Statute Book (www.irishstatutebook.ie), are the official
text; a Revised Act is not.

Reuse terms. The electronic Irish Statute Book, on whose identifiers and annotations the Revised Acts are built,
states (https://www.irishstatutebook.ie/eli/open-data.html, read 28 October 2026):

    Re-use of the data on this web site is subject to the OIREACHTAS (OPEN DATA) PSI LICENCE, which is a standard
    licence for the purposes of Directive (EU) 2019/1024 on open data and the re-use of public sector information as
    transposed into Irish law by the European Union (Open Data and Re-use of Public Sector Information) Regulations
    2021 ( S.I. No. 376/2021 ). This licence incorporates the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
    for the re-use of Public Sector Information.

and its pages carry: "Oireachtas Copyright Material is reproduced with the permission of the Houses of the
Oireachtas." The licence: https://www.oireachtas.ie/en/open-data/license/

Attribution: Contains Oireachtas Copyright Material, reproduced with the permission of the Houses of the Oireachtas
under the Oireachtas (Open Data) PSI Licence (CC BY 4.0); consolidated text from the Revised Acts of the Law Reform
Commission (revisedacts.lawreform.ie). Changed: split into one file per provision, annotation marks removed, layout
normalised, and arranged as a history of commits.

NOT SETTLED: the Revised Acts site itself (revisedacts.lawreform.ie) states only "All content Copyright 2026" and
names no licence. Whether the Oireachtas (Open Data) PSI Licence covers the Commission's Revised Acts, or the
Commission's own consolidation work, is not stated anywhere we found. Until the Commission confirms its terms, this
repository is private and is not to be redistributed.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
